note How a tour is made outside a read, so every tour has a kind from birth; the other way is Tour::new from a file. A name already taken is no change; one differing only in letter case is CaseClash. The build-tour wizard starts a new tour as a flow and offers the other kinds; the CLI takes the kind as an argument.

