note The three kinds, in domain. Flow is a workflow, what happens when X; Layer is an abstraction boundary, the functions that form its surface; Data is a data structure and what mutates it. VARIANTS (the VariantArray derive) lists them for the front ends. The enum has no string form of its own: each boundary words it.

